## Dataset Attribution

This project uses the **Fake and real news dataset** from Kaggle.

**Dataset Source**: Kaggle - Fake and real news dataset  
**Original Authors**: Various news outlets and fact-checking websites  
**Usage**: Educational and research purposes as part of CodeVedX Internship Program  

